file comparisons (see\n`tests/golden.rs::normalize_pdf`). This makes the renderer suitable for the\ngolden-file regression workflow that lands in P2-12."},"131":{"id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf-57","page_id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf#engine","content":"**TTF embedding + auto-subsetting.** `PdfSaveOptions { subset_fonts: true, .. }`\nkeeps the output reasonable when only a small Cyrillic / Mongolian-script glyph set\nis actually drawn."},"132":{"id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf-58","page_id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf#engine","content":"**No higher-level layout engine.** The renderer is data-driven from `OmrTemplate`,\nwhich already encodes every coordinate. A library that re-imposes its own flow\nlayout (genpdf, weasyprint) just gets in the way."},"133":{"id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf-59","page_id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf#bubble-geometry-locked-for-p3-01--p3-02","content":"Property"},"134":{"id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf-60","page_id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf#bubble-geometry-locked-for-p3-01--p3-02","content":"Value"},"135":{"id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf-61","page_id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf#bubble-geometry-locked-for-p3-01--p3-02","content":"Bubble diameter"},"136":{"id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf-62","page_id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-printpdf#bubble-geometry-locked-for-p3-01--p3-02","content":"**2.5 mm**"},"137":{"id":"/en/docs/adr/0002-pdf-generator-pr