peScript\ninterfaces into `src/lib/types/generated/` when `cargo test -p shalgalt-core` runs. The\nfrontend script `pnpm generate-types` wraps the same command. A drift between the Rust struct\nand the generated TS fails `pnpm check` in CI — this is the mechanical enforcement of\nRule 3."},"1226":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"page","content":"Загвар засварлагч","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor"},"1227":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor","content":"Хариултын хуудасны загварыг визуал засварлагчид зохиох."},"1228":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#үндсэн-алхмууд","content":"Үндсэн алхмууд"},"1229":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#засварлагчийг-нээх","content":"Засварлагчийг нээх"},"1230":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#дэвсгэр-зураг-импортлох","content":"Дэвсгэр зураг импортлох"},"1231":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#бөмбөлгийн-бүлэг-нэмэх","content":"Бөмбөлгийн бүлэг нэмэх"},"1232":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#хадгалах","content":"Хадгалах"},"1233":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#pdf-болгон-гаргах","content":"PDF болгон гаргах"},"1234":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#зөвлөмж","content":"Зөвлөмж"},"1235":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor","content":"Засварлагч нь хариултын хуудасны **загвар** (template) зохиох газар юм. Загвар нь дараах\nхэсгүүдээс бүрдэнэ:"},"1236":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor","content":"**Булангийн тэмдэг (ArUco)** — хуудасны 4 буланд байрлах бөгөөд програм хуудсыг танихад\nашиглана. Анхдагчаар бэлэн ирнэ."},"1237":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor","content":"**Бөмбөлгийн бүлэг** — асуулт бүрийн сонголтын бөмбөлгүүд (жишээ нь A, B, C, D)."},"1238":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor","content":"**Сурагчийн дугаар** ба **Хувилбар**-ын бүлэг (заавал биш)."},"1239":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#засварлагчийг-нээх","content":"**Хяналтын самбар → Шинэ загвар** дарж засварлагчийг нээнэ. Эсвэл одоо байгаа загвараа\nнээнэ."},"1240":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#дэвсгэр-зураг-импортлох","content":"Шаардлагатай бол **дэвсгэр зураг** (хэвлэсэн хуудасны зураг/PDF) импортлон, түүн дээрээ\nбөмбөлгүүдээ тааруулна."},"1241":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#бөмбөлгийн-бүлэг-нэмэх","content":"**Бөмбөлгийн бүлэг нэмэх** товчоор асуултуудаа нэмж, тоо, зай, оноог тохируулна."},"1242":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-15","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#хадгалах","content":"**Хадгалах** дарна. **Буцаах / Дахих** (undo/redo) товчлуурууд дэмжигдэнэ."},"1243":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-16","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#pdf-болгон-гаргах","content":"**PDF болгон гаргах** товчоор хэвлэхэд бэлэн хуудас үүсгэнэ."},"1244":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-17","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#pdf-болгон-гаргах","content":"Засварлагчийн хэрэгслийн мөр (шинэ/нээх/хадгалах/буцаах/гаргах)."},"1245":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-18","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#зөвлөмж","content":"Бүх координат **0–1 хооронд хувь**-аар хадгалагдах тул нэг загвар янз бүрийн хэмжээ,\nчанартай хэвлэлд тохирно."},"1246":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-19","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#зөвлөмж","content":"Хэвлэхдээ масштабыг 100% байлгана — Хэвлэх зөвлөмж."},"1247":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"page","content":"Шалгалт удирдах","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams"},"1248":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams","content":"Шалгалт үүсгэх, хариултын түлхүүр (хувилбар) оруулах."},"1249":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-үүсгэх","content":"Шалгалт үүсгэх"},"1250":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-цэс-рүү-орох","content":"Шалгалт цэс рүү орох"},"1251":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шинэ-шалгалт-үүсгэх","content":"Шинэ шалгалт үүсгэх"},"1252":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#жагсаалтаас-харах","content":"Жагсаалтаас харах"},"1253":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"Хариултын түлхүүр (хувилбар) оруулах"},"1254":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#тэмдэглэл","content":"Тэмдэглэл"},"1255":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams","content":"**Шалгалт** нь нэг загвар дээр суурилсан, өөрийн **хариултын түлхүүр**-тэй нэгж юм. Нэг\nшалгалт олон **хувилбар**-тай байж болно (жишээ нь A, B хувилбар)."},"1256":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-цэс-рүү-орох","content":"**Шалгалт** цэс рүү орно."},"1257":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шинэ-шалгалт-үүсгэх","content":"**Шинэ шалгалт** дарж нэр өгч, ашиглах **загвар**-аа сонгоно."},"1258":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#жагсаалтаас-харах","content":"Үүссэн шалгалт жагсаалтад нэр, загвар, хувилбарын тоо, огнооны хамт харагдана."},"1259":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"Шалгалтаа нээгээд хувилбар нэмнэ. Зөв хариултыг оруулах **хоёр арга**:"},"1260":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"Асуулт бүрийн зөв хариултыг сонгоно."},"1261":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"Багшийн бөглөсөн нэг хуудсыг сканнердаж, програмаар уншуулаад, зэрэгцүүлэн шалгаж\nхадгална."},"1262":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"Шалгалтын дэлгэрэнгүй — хувилбарын жагсаалт ба хариултын түлхүүр засах."},"1263":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-15","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#тэмдэглэл","content":"Хариултын түлхүүр нь тухайн шалгалтын **асуултуудын багц** юм. Хэрэв зарим асуултад түлхүүр\nоруулаагүй бол (хэсэгчилсэн шалгалт) тэдгээр асуултыг дүгнэхдээ алгасна."},"1264":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"page","content":"Excel рүү гаргах","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export"},"1265":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export","content":"Шалгалтын дүнг Excel хүснэгт болгон гаргах, дүнгийн жагсаалт үзэх."},"1266":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export#дүнгийн-жагсаалт","content":"Дүнгийн жагсаалт"},"1267":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Дэлгэрэнгүй үзэх"},"1268":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export#excel-рүү-гаргах","content":"Excel рүү гаргах"},"1269":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дүнгийн-жагсаалт","content":"**Дүн** цэс нь хийгдсэн дүгнэлтүүдийн түүхийг харуулна. Та **загвар**-аар, мөн **шалгах\nшаардлагатай** эсэхээр шүүж, хуудаслан үзэж болно. Мөр бүр загвар, огноо, хуудасны тоо,\nшалгах шаардлагатай хуудасны тоог харуулна."},"1270":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Дүгнэлт сонгоход:"},"1271":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Зүүн талд **сурагч бүрийн оноо**-ны жагсаалт."},"1272":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Голд сонгосон сурагчийн **хуудасны зураг**, мета мэдээлэл, **асуулт тус бүрийн үр дүн**\n(зөв/буруу/хоосон)."},"1273":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Дэлгэцийн зураг: Дүгнэлтийн дэлгэрэнгүй — сурагчийн жагсаалт ба асуултын задаргаа."},"1274":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#excel-рүү-гаргах","content":"**Excel рүү гаргах** товчоор дүнг `.xlsx` файл болгон татаж авна. Хүснэгтэд сурагчдын оноо,\nасуулт бүрийн үр дүн зэрэг багтана. Баганын гарчиг зэрэг бүх текст **монгол хэл**-ээр гарна."},"1275":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"page","content":"Дүгнэх","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading"},"1276":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading","content":"Сканнердсан хуудаснуудыг багцаар автоматаар дүгнэх."},"1277":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#алхмууд","content":"Алхмууд"},"1278":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#дүгнэх-цэс-рүү-орох","content":"Дүгнэх цэс рүү орох"},"1279":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#файлуудаа-сонгох","content":"Файлуудаа сонгох"},"1280":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#шалгалт-ба-хувилбар-сонгох","content":"Шалгалт ба хувилбар сонгох"},"1281":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#эхлүүлэх","content":"Эхлүүлэх"},"1282":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#дүн-харах","content":"Дүн харах"},"1283":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#итгэлийн-оноо-ба-шалгах-шаардлага","content":"Итгэлийн оноо ба шалгах шаардлага"},"1284":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#зөвлөмж","content":"Зөвлөмж"},"1285":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading","content":"Дүгнэх дэлгэц нь сканнердсан буюу гар утсаар авсан хуудаснуудыг **багцаар** автоматаар уншиж\nоноо тавина."},"1286":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#дүгнэх-цэс-рүү-орох","content":"**Дүгнэх** цэс рүү орно."},"1287":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#файлуудаа-сонгох","content":"Сканнердсан &#x2A;*PDF файл(ууд)**-аа сонгоно (олон файл/олон хуудас дэмжигдэнэ)."},"1288":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#шалгалт-ба-хувилбар-сонгох","content":"Дүгнэх **шалгалт** ба **хувилбар**-аа сонгоно. Олон хувилбартай үед **автомат таних**-ийг\nидэвхжүүлж болно — хуудас бүрийн хувилбарын бүлгээс уншина."},"1289":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#эхлүүлэх","content":"**Эхлүүлэх** дарна. Явц **дэвшилтийн мөр**-өөр харагдана (хуудас засварлах, тэмдэг таних,\nбөмбөлөг хэмжих гэх мэт үе шатууд). Энэ хооронд програм **царцахгүй**."},"1290":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#дүн-харах","content":"Дуусахад нийт хуудас, дундаж оноо, **шалгах шаардлагатай** хуудасны тоо харагдана."},"1291":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-15","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#дүн-харах","content":"Дүгнэх дэлгэц — файл сонголт, хувилбар, дэвшилтийн мөр."},"1292":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-16","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#итгэлийн-оноо-ба-шалгах-шаардлага","content":"Программ бөмбөлөг бүрийн дүүргэлтийг хэмжиж **итгэлийн оноо** тооцно. Хэрэв аль нэг бөмбөлгийн\nитгэл эргэлзээтэй мужид (хагас будсан) орвол тухайн хуудсыг **шалгах шаардлагатай** гэж\nтэмдэглэнэ. Эдгээрийг Гараар шалгах дэлгэцэд засна."},"1293":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-17","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#зөвлөмж","content":"Сканнердах чанар үр дүнд шууд нөлөөлнө — Сканнердах зөвлөмж-ийг үзнэ үү."},"1294":{"id":"/en/docs/user","page_id":"/en/docs/user","type":"page","content":"Introduction","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user"},"1295":{"id":"/en/docs/user-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"shalgalt-omr — grade OMR answer sheets fully offline."},"1296":{"id":"/en/docs/user-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Where to start"},"1297":{"id":"/en/docs/user-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user#privacy","content":"Privacy"},"1298":{"id":"/en/docs/user-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"**shalgalt-omr** reads and grades OMR (fill-the-bubble) answer sheets automatically,\n**fully offline**, on your own computer. As a teacher you can:"},"1299":{"id":"/en/docs/user-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"Draw the answer-sheet layout in a visual editor."},"1300":{"id":"/en/docs/user-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"Save that template as a print-ready PDF."},"1301":{"id":"/en/docs/user-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"Grade scanned or phone-photographed sheets automatically."},"1302":{"id":"/en/docs/user-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"Review low-confidence sheets by hand."},"1303":{"id":"/en/docs/user-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"Export results to Excel, or share a whole project as a `.shalgalt` file."},"1304":{"id":"/en/docs/user-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"The interface of the application itself is in **Mongolian only**. This English manual is a\ntranslation of the Mongolian user guide; some pages may fall back to Mongolian until their\ntranslation is added."},"1305":{"id":"/en/docs/user-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"First time? Start here."},"1306":{"id":"/en/docs/user-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Design the answer-sheet template."},"1307":{"id":"/en/docs/user-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Create exams and enter answer keys."},"1308":{"id":"/en/docs/user-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Grade scanned sheets in batches."},"1309":{"id":"/en/docs/user-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Check flagged sheets bubble by bubble."},"1310":{"id":"/en/docs/user-15","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Export results to a spreadsheet."},"1311":{"id":"/en/docs/user-16","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Save and share a whole project as a `.shalgalt` file."},"1312":{"id":"/en/docs/user-17","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Printing tips."},"1313":{"id":"/en/docs/user-18","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Phone-scanning tips."},"1314":{"id":"/en/docs/user-19","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Something went wrong? Find answers here."},"1315":{"id":"/en/docs/user-20","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#privacy","content":"The app needs **no internet** and sends **nothing** anywhere. Student data stays on your\ncomputer. See the Privacy statement."},"1316":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","type":"page","content":"Хэвлэх зөвлөмж","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Tips"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/printing"},"1317":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing","content":"Хариултын хуудсыг зөв хэвлэх — цаас, бэх, масштаб."},"1318":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing","content":"Хариултын хуудсыг зөв хэвлэх нь автомат таних чанарт шууд нөлөөлнө."},"1319":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing","content":"\"Fit to page\" / \"хуудсанд багтаах\" сонголтыг **унтраа**. Багасгаж/томруулж хэвлэвэл\nбөмбөлгийн байрлал зөрж таних алдаа гарна."},"1320":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing","content":"**Тод хар бэх, хангалттай тонер.** Бүдэг хэвлэлт булангийн ArUco тэмдгийг таниулахад хүндрэл\nучруулна."},"1321":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing","content":"**Цагаан, гялбаагүй (matte) A4 цаас.** Өнгөт эсвэл гялгар цаас сканнердахад туссан гэрэл\nүүсгэж болзошгүй."},"1322":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing","content":"**Хуудсыг бүтнээр нь хэвлэ** — 4 булангийн тэмдэг бүгд гарсан эсэхийг шалга."},"1323":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing","content":"Олон хувь хэвлэхдээ нэгийг туршиж сканнердан үзээд дараа нь олноор хэвлэвэл найдвартай."},"1324":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","type":"page","content":"Нууцлалын мэдэгдэл","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Tips"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/privacy"},"1325":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"Ямар ч мэдээлэл гадагш илгээдэггүй — бүрэн офлайн."},"1326":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"shalgalt-omr нь **нууцлалыг эн тэргүүнд** тавьсан, бүрэн офлайн программ юм."},"1327":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"Дүгнэх, хадгалах, гаргах бүх үйлдэл таны компьютер дээр явагдах тул интернэт шаарддаггүй."},"1328":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"**Ямар ч мэдээлэл гадагш илгээдэггүй.** Телеметр, алдааны тайлан, аналитик **байхгүй**."},"1329":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"**Сурагчдын мэдээлэл зөвхөн локал** өгөгдлийн санд хадгалагдана."},"1330":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"`.shalgalt` файлыг хуваалцахдаа **нууц үгээр шифрлэх** боломжтой. Шифрлэсэн үед ч төслийн\nерөнхий мэдээллийн (manifest) хэсэгт **хувийн мэдээлэл агуулагдахгүй**."},"1331":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"Зөвхөн &#x2A;*локал бүртгэл (log)** хөтлөгдөж, тодорхой хэмжээнд эргэлдэж шинэчлэгдэнэ."},"1332":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"Автомат шинэчлэлт (auto-update) нь **анхдагчаар унтраалттай** тул офлайн орчинд ажилладаг\nсургуулиуд ямар нэг сүлжээний хүсэлт хүлээж авахгүй. Та тохиргооноос гараар асааж болно."},"1333":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"page","content":"Төслийн файл (.shalgalt)","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files"},"1334":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files","content":"Бүх шалгалтын төслийг нэг файлд хадгалах, хуваалцах, нээх."},"1335":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"Онцлог"},"1336":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#нээх-ба-хадгалах","content":"Нээх ба хадгалах"},"1337":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#жишээ-файлууд","content":"Жишээ файлууд"},"1338":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files","content":"`.shalgalt` файл нь **бүхэл шалгалтын төсөл**-ийг (загвар + хариултын түлхүүр + дүгнэсэн\nхуудаснууд + сурагчдын жагсаалт) нэг файлд багтаасан хэлбэр юм. Үүгээр та өөр компьютер\nруу зөөх, эсвэл хамтран ажиллагсадтайгаа хуваалцаж болно."},"1339":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"Нэг файл, ердийн zip хэлбэртэй тул шифрлээгүй үед ямар ч zip програмаар нээж үзэж болно."},"1340":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"**Нэмэлтээр нууцлах боломжтой** — нууц үг (passphrase) тавьж бүх агуулгыг шифрлэнэ."},"1341":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"Гарчиг, огноо, хуудасны тоо зэргийг агуулсан **manifest хэсэг нь үргэлж задгай** байдаг тул\nнууц үг оруулахаас өмнө төслийн ерөнхий мэдээллийг урьдчилан харж болно."},"1342":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"manifest хэсэгт сурагчдын хувийн мэдээлэл **байхгүй**."},"1343":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#нээх-ба-хадгалах","content":"**Нээх** — `.shalgalt` файл дээр давхар товшиход програм нээгдэж, шифрлэсэн бол нууц үг\nасууна. Агуулга нь таны локал санд сэргээгдэнэ."},"1344":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#нээх-ба-хадгалах","content":"**Хадгалах / Гаргах** — төслөө `.shalgalt` болгон гаргахдаа нууц үг тавих эсэхээ сонгоно."},"1345":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#нээх-ба-хадгалах","content":"Дэлгэцийн зураг: Төсөл нээх — нууц үг асуух цонх."},"1346":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#жишээ-файлууд","content":"Гурван бэлэн жишээ төслийг татаж аваад туршиж үзэж болно (нээлттэй / шифрлэсэн / PDF-тэй)."},"1347":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"page","content":"Quick start","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start"},"1348":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","content":"From installing the app to grading your first exam."},"1349":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#install","content":"Install"},"1350":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#design-a-template","content":"Design a template"},"1351":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#generate-a-printable-pdf","content":"Generate a printable PDF"},"1352":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#create-an-exam-and-answer-key","content":"Create an exam and answer key"},"1353":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#grade-the-sheets","content":"Grade the sheets"},"1354":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#review-flagged-sheets","content":"Review flagged sheets"},"1355":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#export-results","content":"Export results"},"1356":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","content":"This page walks you from **install → first template → first grade run**."},"1357":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#install","content":"Download the build for your OS from the\nReleases page (Windows\n`.exe`/`.msi`, macOS `.dmg`, Linux `.AppImage`/`.deb`) and install it."},"1358":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#install","content":"On first launch the database is created automatically on your computer. No setup needed."},"1359":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#install","content":"Dashboard (home). Checklist: `docs/user/screenshots-needed.md`."},"1360":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#design-a-template","content":"On the **Dashboard**, click **New template** to open the Editor."},"1361":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#design-a-template","content":"Place the four corner **ArUco markers** (provided by default)."},"1362":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#design-a-template","content":"Add **bubble groups** for your questions (e.g. A–D), plus **Student ID** and **Variant**\ngroups if needed."},"1363":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-15","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#design-a-template","content":"Click **Save**."},"1364":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-16","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#design-a-template","content":"Editor toolbar and a bubble group."},"1365":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-17","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#generate-a-printable-pdf","content":"Click **Export PDF** in the editor to save a print-ready sheet. Mind the\nprinting tips (100% scale, solid black ink)."},"1366":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-18","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#create-an-exam-and-answer-key","content":"Go to **Exams → New exam** and pick the template you just made."},"1367":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-19","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#create-an-exam-and-answer-key","content":"Add an &#x2A;*answer key (variant)** to the exam — choose the correct answers by hand, or\n**scan** one filled sheet to read them in."},"1368":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-20","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#create-an-exam-and-answer-key","content":"Exam detail — editing the answer key."},"1369":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-21","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#grade-the-sheets","content":"Open **Grade**."},"1370":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-22","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#grade-the-sheets","content":"Select the scanned &#x2A;*PDF file(s)**."},"1371":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-23","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#grade-the-sheets","content":"Choose which **